title: "Benchmark configurations, flow-field data and trained policies for learned active flow control"
abstract: "Reproducible case definitions, reference flow-field data and trained control policies for the bluff-body active-flow-control benchmarks (circular, square and elliptical bodies, Re = 100-2000), supporting independent reproduction and reuse."
